{"t":"Crystal Wolf (Mount)","s":"crystal-wolf-mount-66e6a","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Crystal_Wolf_Mount_c9fecf.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"actualname\">Crystal Wolf</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Crystal Wolf (Mount)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Wolf_Mount_c9fecf.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"speed\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed Bonus</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>+10 speed</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"taming_method\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Taming method</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Diapason\">Diapason</a> on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colourisable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colourisable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought in<br/>Store</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"achievement\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Achievement</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>The Right Tone</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightradius\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ccffff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span>  <span style=\"179|margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">5 sqm</span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.10<br/>July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"artwork\">\n<img alt=\"Crystal Wolf artwork\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"154\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Wolf_artwork_cb0e2c.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">Official Artwork</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Mounts, [1] <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-mount-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>To obtain this mount, use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Diapason\">Diapason</a> on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a>. Note: The <a href=\"#/wiki/Diapason\">Diapason</a> has a chance of breaking when used.<br/> The mounts Crystal Wolf and <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Horse\">War Horse</a> were chosen by players in a poll.\nThe mount emits a small amount (around the same amount like <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Starlight\">Frozen Starlight</a>) of blue-green light.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"cdad1ab86b0461db234ad28fa89f1d61\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:306px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:217px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Crystal_Wolf_mount-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:215px; width:304px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Wolf_mount_e09f06.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Crystal Wolf mount.png (1.31 MB)\" width=\"304\"/></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Mounts\">Related Mounts</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Free_Mounts\">Free Mounts</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Alpha Demonosaur</li><li>Antelope</li><li>Ashen Coast Predator</li><li>Battlefrazzle</li><li>Black Sheep (Mount)</li><li>Blazebringer</li><li>Blue Rolling Barrel</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bright%20Percht%20Sleigh\">Bright Percht Sleigh</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bright%20Percht%20Sleigh%20Variant\">Bright Percht Sleigh Variant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cold%20Percht%20Sleigh\">Cold Percht Sleigh</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cold%20Percht%20Sleigh%20Variant\">Cold Percht Sleigh Variant</a></li><li>Crimson Bay Predator</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Percht%20Sleigh\">Dark Percht Sleigh</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Percht%20Sleigh%20Variant\">Dark Percht Sleigh Variant</a></li><li>Donkey</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonling%20%28Mount%29\">Dragonling (Mount)</a></li><li>Draptor (Mount)</li><li>Dromedary (Mount)</li><li